<section id="about" class="ns-section ns-about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="ns-container ns-about__grid">
    <figure class="ns-about__portrait">
      <%= image_tag "profile_pic_2.jpg", width: 240, height: 240, loading: "lazy", alt: "Spencer Norman" %>
      <figcaption><strong>Spencer Norman</strong><span>Norman Simplified</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="ns-prose">
      <header class="ns-section-heading">
        <p class="sn-eyebrow"><span class="sn-eyebrow__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>Who does the work</p>
        <h2 id="about-title" class="t-heading">You work with me</h2>
      </header>
      <p class="ns-lead">I'm Spencer Norman. Norman Simplified is my practice, and has been since 2015. I have spent 11 years building software, most of it in Rails. You are not handed to an account manager.</p>
      <p>From 2016 to 2025 I was the lead developer at United Networks of America, on a pharmacy API now used by 9,800+ locations and a multi-tenant medication-pricing platform. I use that as proof that I have shipped careful systems. I am not selling healthcare projects. <%= link_to "See the FAQ.", studio_root_path(anchor: "faq"), class: "ns-inline-link" %></p>
      <p>I take a small number of clients at a time. On the call I will tell you if I can start.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
